 * C3.0.08 	adjusted version to tag
 * C3.0.09	adjusted version to anchor
 * C3.0.11	[changed] self id flash address
 * C3.0.12	[fixed[ bootloader can program bank 2
 * C3.0.13	[changed] mass erase execution
 * C3.0.14	[modified] OTU update doesnt requires power reset
 * C3.0.15	[changed] Masserase function name
 * C3.0.16	[add] CRC & length validation
